# Change management

Signed-off decisions (A #1–#64, H #1–#9 / H2-1…H2-15, C #1–#23, D-1…D-17, E-1…E-28) are not to be silently reversed.

If a change would alter one: stop and follow `.cursor/workflows/architectural-decision.md`. Append a new numbered decision to the module spec; do not edit the old entry’s meaning.

Especially load-bearing: backend-only access (§5.1), membership guard (#41), ledger-truth status, advisory-lock order, COA account numbers, Bill entity Option A (E-1), one-cron scheduler (D-16), no posted-row deletes.